IMPORT prelude

-- Codex Insurance Limited hospital indemnity policy, encoded from
-- fixtures/chubb-policy.txt.
--
-- The DECLAREs and the two supporting helpers below are copied verbatim
-- from bench/schema-l4.md so that this file is self-contained. No claim
-- data lives in this file -- see apply.l4.

§ `Fact schema`

DECLARE Ground IS ONE OF Sickness, `Accidental injury`, Neither

DECLARE Cause IS ONE OF
  Skydiving, `Military service`, Firefighting, `Police service`, Other

DECLARE Claim
  HAS `agreement signed`                           IS A BOOLEAN
      `premium paid month`                         IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `hospitalization month`                      IS A NUMBER
      `hospitalization ground`                     IS A Ground
      `age at hospitalization`                     IS A NUMBER
      `causes`                                     IS A LIST OF Cause
      `fraud month`                                IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `misrepresentation month`                    IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `wellness visit month`                       IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `wellness visit provider qualified`          IS A BOOLEAN
      `written confirmation month`                 IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `dispute arisen`                             IS A BOOLEAN
      `unable to settle month`                     IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `arbitration commenced month`                IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `valid arbitration award issued`             IS A BOOLEAN
      `written proof of claim month`               IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `recovery sought month`                      IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `policy term months`                         IS A NUMBER

§ `Supporting helpers`

GIVEN  `event month` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
       `limit month` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`no later than` MEANS
  CONSIDER `event month`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
    WHEN JUST m  THEN m AT MOST `limit month`

GIVEN  cs IS A LIST OF Cause
       c  IS A Cause
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`arose out of` MEANS elem c cs

§ `Section 1 -- Policy in effect and conditions`

§§ `1.1a -- the hospitalization itself must be for sickness or accidental injury`

GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`hospitalization is of a covered kind` MEANS
    CONSIDER (claim's `hospitalization ground`)
        WHEN Sickness            THEN TRUE
        WHEN `Accidental injury` THEN TRUE
        WHEN Neither             THEN FALSE

§§ `1.3 -- wellness-visit confirmation condition`
-- No later than the 7th month anniversary, the insured must supply written
-- confirmation, from a qualified medical provider, of a wellness visit that
-- itself occurred no later than the 6th month anniversary.

GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`section 1.3 satisfied` MEANS
        `no later than` (claim's `written confirmation month`) 7
    AND `no later than` (claim's `wellness visit month`) 6
    AND claim's `wellness visit provider qualified`

-- As of the time of hospitalization, the 7-month deadline for supplying
-- written confirmation may simply not have arrived yet -- in which case
-- Section 1.3 has not been breached, whatever happens to it afterwards.
GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`section 1.3 still pending` MEANS
    claim's `hospitalization month` AT MOST 7

GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`section 1.3 pending or satisfied` MEANS
        `section 1.3 still pending` claim
    OR  `section 1.3 satisfied` claim

§§ `1.2 -- cancelation`

-- Fraud or misrepresentation cancels the policy from the moment it occurs.
-- It only defeats a claim premised on a hospitalization at or after that
-- moment -- fraud discovered later than the hospitalization in question
-- does not retroactively undo a claim that was already good.
GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`no disqualifying fraud or misrepresentation` MEANS
        NOT (`no later than` (claim's `fraud month`) (claim's `hospitalization month`))
    AND NOT (`no later than` (claim's `misrepresentation month`) (claim's `hospitalization month`))

-- Automatic cancelation at midnight on the last day of the policy term.
GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`policy term has not expired` MEANS
    claim's `hospitalization month` AT MOST claim's `policy term months`

GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`policy not canceled` MEANS
        `no disqualifying fraud or misrepresentation` claim
    AND `section 1.3 pending or satisfied` claim
    AND `policy term has not expired` claim

§§ `1.1b -- the policy itself must be in effect`

GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`policy in effect at hospitalization` MEANS
        claim's `agreement signed`
    AND isJust (claim's `premium paid month`)
    AND `policy not canceled` claim

§ `Section 2 -- General exclusions`

§§ `2.1 -- excluded activities and age`
-- Section 3.1.1 confirms the policy covers the insured worldwide, so no
-- exclusion turns on location; there is no such field in Claim.

GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`excluded by activity or age` MEANS
        `arose out of` (claim's `causes`) Skydiving
    OR  `arose out of` (claim's `causes`) `Military service`
    OR  `arose out of` (claim's `causes`) Firefighting
    OR  `arose out of` (claim's `causes`) `Police service`
    OR  claim's `age at hospitalization` AT LEAST 80

§ `Section 3 -- General conditions`

§§ `3.2 -- arbitration and the 60-day recovery bar`

-- Arbitration must be commenced within three months of the parties
-- becoming unable to settle; if none arose, this leg is trivially timely.
GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`arbitration commenced timely` MEANS
    CONSIDER (claim's `unable to settle month`)
        WHEN NOTHING THEN TRUE
        WHEN JUST u  THEN `no later than` (claim's `arbitration commenced month`) (u PLUS 3)

-- If a dispute arose, timely arbitration AND a valid award are both
-- conditions precedent to liability; failing to arbitrate on time
-- extinguishes the claim outright.
GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`arbitration condition satisfied` MEANS
        NOT claim's `dispute arisen`
    OR  (   `arbitration commenced timely` claim
        AND claim's `valid arbitration award issued`)

-- No recovery may be sought within 60 days (taken here as two months) of
-- submitting written proof of claim.
GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`recovery not premature` MEANS
    CONSIDER (claim's `recovery sought month`)
        WHEN NOTHING THEN TRUE
        WHEN JUST r  THEN
            CONSIDER (claim's `written proof of claim month`)
                WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
                WHEN JUST p  THEN r AT LEAST (p PLUS 2)

§ `Coverage decision`

GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
covered MEANS
        `policy in effect at hospitalization` claim
    AND `hospitalization is of a covered kind` claim
    AND NOT `excluded by activity or age` claim
    AND `arbitration condition satisfied` claim
    AND `recovery not premature` claim
